Face it, Sam.

293
00:24:45.889 --> 00:24:47.122
You need a new bullet
under that...

294
00:24:47.124 --> 00:24:48.926
I don't got that kind of money.

295
00:24:49.727 --> 00:24:52.027
Well, you better find it,
because you're gonna

296
00:24:52.029 --> 00:24:53.028
