that for the last three years.

299
00:24:57.302 --> 00:25:00.304
Look where it's gotten you.
I'll tell you where. Nowhere.

300
00:25:00.904 --> 00:25:03.172
You're starting
to sound like Cam.

301
00:25:03.174 --> 00:25:05.074
Well, I hate to say it,
but Cam is right.

302
00:25:05.076 --> 00:25:06.774
I don't wanna talk about it.

303
00:25:11.782 --> 00:25:13.184
That's what a motor sounds like.

304
00:25:40.878 --> 00:25:42.147
I'll be damned.

305
00:26:17.149 --> 00:26:18.316
What'd you think of that, kid?

306
00:26:21.853 --> 00:26:23.054
It's a fast son of a bitch,
huh?

307
00:26:26.124 --> 00:26:28.360
- Never been in anything faster.
- You're God damn right.

308
00:26:30.463 --> 00:26:32.896
All you gotta do now is just do
the same thing

309
00:26:32.898 --> 00:26:33.899
when it counts, right?

310
00:26:36.066 --> 00:26:37.933
If anything goes wrong with
that heap of shit,

311
00:26:37.935 --> 00:26:39.502
you let me know,
and I'll fix it right up

312
00:26:39.504 --> 00:26:41.206
- for you, okay?
- All right.

313
00:26:43.508 --> 00:26:44.743
Good job.

314
00:26:50.182 --> 00:26:52.148
<i>Twelve laps of
racing action</i>

315
00:26:52.150 --> 00:26:53.517
<i>in the super late model
