320
00:27:14.039 --> 00:27:17.074
<i>Here we go! We have Cam Munroe</i>

321
00:27:17.076 --> 00:27:19.343
<i>in the lead in a brand
spanking new ride,</i>

322
00:27:19.345 --> 00:27:21.412
<i>now racing for
Bob Linsky's team.</i>

323
00:27:21.414 --> 00:27:23.982
<i>That's right. Like
