333
00:28:01.887 --> 00:28:03.022
This is mine now.

334
00:28:04.357 --> 00:28:05.657
<i>We're nearing
the end of heat number two,</i>

335
00:28:05.659 --> 00:28:09.494
<i>and this one has been all Bob
