341
00:28:33.587 --> 00:28:35.386
<i>Sam "The Man" Munroe.</i>

342
00:28:35.388 --> 00:28:37.621
<i>Certainly no
driver has won more races here,</i>

343
00:28:37.623 --> 00:28:40.525
<i>but Sam hasn't driven on
