346
00:28:46.633 --> 00:28:50.135
<i>his old arch rival Bob Linsky.
Hell, you can't write</i>

347
00:28:50.137 --> 00:28:51.305
<i>this any better.</i>

348
00:28:52.539 --> 00:28:53.772
<i>Heat number three
is winding down,</i>

349
00:28:53.774 --> 00:28:57.342
<i>and Sam Munroe seems
to have shaken off the cobwebs</i>

350
00:28:57.344 --> 00:28:59.579
