362
00:29:43.558 --> 00:29:45.326
<i>18 cars on the track.</i>

363
00:29:45.593 --> 00:29:47.394
<i>Here we go!</i>

364
00:29:49.029 --> 00:29:51.096
<i>The green flag drops,
and the family reunion</i>

365
00:29:51.098 --> 00:29:54.034
<i>is in full force tonight
