366
00:29:55.202 --> 00:29:57.536
<i>Power racing right
from the start here tonight,</i>

367
00:29:57.538 --> 00:30:00.673
<i>with Linsky and Cam Munroe
already starting to walk away</i>

368
00:30:00.675 --> 00:30:03.074
<i>from the field.
Sam Munroe included.</i>

369
00:30:03.076 --> 00:30:05.344
<i>I just don't know
if Sam has the machine to hang</i>

370
00:30:05.346 --> 00:30:06.981
<i>with Linsky's new car.</i>

371
00:30:08.683 --> 00:30:09.915
<i>There they are,
side by side.</i>

372
00:30:09.917 --> 00:30:13.251
<i>It's Linsky and Cam Munroe
looking like figure skaters</i>

373
00:30:13.253 --> 00:30:15.222
<i>putting on a
show for the crowd.</i>

374
00:30:18.593 --> 00:30:20.528
<i>And Linsky
pulls out in front now.</i>

375
00:30:22.530 --> 00:30:24.964
<i>Here comes
Sam Munroe barreling around</i>

376
00:30:24.966 --> 00:30:27.235
<i>the outside going for
a gutsy pass on his son.</i>

377
00:30:28.369 --> 00:30:30.636
<i>Sam Munroe and Linsky,
two of the best ever,</i>

378
00:30:30.638 --> 00:30:32.606
<i>tangled going into turn one.</i>

379
00:30:32.608 --> 00:30:34.075
<i>This crowd loves it.</i>

380
00:30:37.978 --> 00:30:39.645
<i>It's Cam Munroe, Linsky,</i>

381
00:30:39.647 --> 00:30:42.583
<i>and Sam Munroe battling back
and forth now.</i>

382
00:30:46.654 --> 00:30:48.687
<i>And there goes
Sam Munroe around Linsky.</i>

383
00:30:48.689 --> 00:30:52.324
- <i>Wow, how does he do that?</i>
- <i>Bob Linsky</i>

384
00:30:52.326 --> 00:30:54.561
<i>immediately gives him
a hard bump and says,</i>

385
00:30:54.563 --> 00:30:56.763
<i>"Welcome back t
o the dirt, Sam."</i>

386
00:30:56.765 --> 00:30:59.063
<i>Sam Munroe slams
right back into Linsky,</i>

387
00:30:59.065 --> 00:31:01.068
<i>closing the door
on his attempted pass. Wow!</i>

388
00:31:03.438 --> 00:31:06.405
<i>These two old veterans
are trading paint now</i>

389
00:31:06.407 --> 00:31:08.109
<i>like it's a demolition derby.</i>

390
00:31:08.476 --> 00:31:11.547
<i>Wow, that was
a pure power move right there.</i>

391
00:31:12.013 --> 00:31:13.680
<i>The gloves are off,
and we are in</i>

392
00:31:13.682 --> 00:31:16.182
<i>an old-fashioned
street fight now.</i>

393
00:31:16.184 --> 00:31:18.285
<i>Cam Munroe
around Linsky. Wow.</i>

394
00:31:18.287 --> 00:31:20.522
<i>The white flag
