409
00:32:11.239 --> 00:32:12.539
I don't want to talk about it.

410
00:32:12.541 --> 00:32:15.310
Oh. Well, who put the buzz
kill bee in your bonnet?

411
00:32:15.844 --> 00:32:17.479
Geez, you ought to
be proud of yourself.

412
00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:20.082
That's some of the best racing
you've done in years.

413
00:32:21.818 --> 00:32:23.185
Hey, Dad?

414
00:32:26.523 --> 00:32:28.223
I just want to say, good race.

415
00:32:30.192 --> 00:32:31.728
Did you get your tools
from the garage?

416
00:32:33.630 --> 00:32:34.528
What?

417
00:32:34.530 --> 00:32:36.765
Did you get your tools
from the garage?

418
00:32:39.635 --> 00:32:41.503
I'll come by tomorrow
after work.

419
00:32:43.272 --> 00:32:44.707
Be sure you do that.

420
00:33:09.164 --> 00:33:11.668
Hey. How are you?

421
00:33:12.769 --> 00:33:13.803
Good.

422
00:33:23.846 --> 00:33:25.615
Sam, you okay?

423
00:33:27.350 --> 00:33:28.685
Cam, he's in there.

424
00:33:30.887 --> 00:33:32.655
I just don't know
what to do about him.

425
00:33:35.325 --> 00:33:39.160
Don't worry. You just gotta
give it some time.

426
00:33:39.162 --> 00:33:40.530
Yeah. Yeah.

427
00:33:43.299 --> 00:33:44.535
You guys will figure it out.

428
00:33:46.669 --> 00:33:47.604
Yeah.

429
00:33:49.706 --> 00:33:51.240
Would it help
