430
00:33:51.841 --> 00:33:53.509
Hell, I don't know.

431
00:33:56.379 --> 00:33:57.614
You all right with that?

432
00:33:57.815 --> 00:34:02.553
- Of course.
- Well, if you are, I guess.

433
00:34:03.186 --> 00:34:05.254
- I'll give it a try.
- All right.

434
00:34:05.856 --> 00:34:11.160
- I'll see you later.
