442
00:34:54.371 --> 00:34:56.573
That's why I've been after Dad
to sell this monster.

443
00:34:56.908 --> 00:35:00.243
It's just been sitting here
untouched for years.

444
00:35:00.978 --> 00:35:02.546
It's not doing anybody
any good...

445
00:35:04.915 --> 00:35:06.316
but you know how stubborn he is.

446
00:35:07.851 --> 00:35:09.453
Like father, like son?

447
00:35:13.524 --> 00:35:16.258
Dad bought the car for Mom
as a gift after he won

448
00:35:16.260 --> 00:35:17.394
his fifth championship.

449
00:35:19.296 --> 00:35:20.897
About a half hour after
they left,

450
00:35:20.899 --> 00:35:24.902
