and something happened.

451
00:35:27.038 --> 00:35:28.439
Dad lost control...

452
00:35:31.810 --> 00:35:32.911
and I lost my mom.

453
00:35:33.678 --> 00:35:36.280
Oh... Cam.

454
00:35:40.685 --> 00:35:41.953
And you keep racing.

455
00:35:42.854 --> 00:35:44.422
It's what Mom would've wanted.

456
00:35:46.323 --> 00:35:47.658
Racing's in our blood.

457
00:35:49.326 --> 00:35:51.060
Welcome back to <i>Trading Paint.</i>

458
00:35:51.062 --> 00:35:53.698
I'm your host,
Sheriff Buck Taylor.

459
00:35:54.065 --> 00:35:56.466
<i>Well, folks, we have
a very special guest</i>

460
00:35:56.468 --> 00:35:57.902
<i>in the studio today.</i>

461
00:35:58.336 --> 00:36:02.638
A man who stands third
