462
00:36:02.640 --> 00:36:06.979
<i>yet to go. Our local legend,
Sam "The Man" Munroe.</i>

463
00:36:07.579 --> 00:36:10.847
Well, Sam, uh...
I want to be the first

464
00:36:10.849 --> 00:36:12.715
to welcome you back.
You haven't been on

465
00:36:12.717 --> 00:36:14.650
- the show in a while, have you?
- No, I haven't,

466
00:36:14.652 --> 00:36:15.653
and I appreciate it.

467
00:36:16.588 --> 00:36:17.854
- Thanks for having me back.
- All right.

468
00:36:17.856 --> 00:36:19.322
Well, I've got to ask you

469
00:36:19.324 --> 00:36:20.890
a question that's on
the minds of all

470
00:36:20.892 --> 00:36:23.459
- the racing fans out there.
- Well, all right.

471
00:36:23.461 --> 00:36:26.598
What is going on with you
